{"hw":"παρακέλευσις","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">παρακέλευσις</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">παρα-κέλευσις</span>, <span class=\"lex-itype gk\">εως</span>, <span class=\"lex-gram\">ἡ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">cheering on, exhorting</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Th.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.70</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">διδαχὴν ἅμα τῇ π. ποιεῖσθαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">4.126</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">ἐκ παρακελεύσεως</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Id.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">7.40</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">π. τοῦ μὴ ποιεῖν δεῖσθαι</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Phld.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Oec.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">p.36</span> </span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">J.</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τυφλοῦ π.</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">advice given</b> by a blind man, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Tht.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">209e</span> </span>: pl., <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">X.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Cyr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">3.3.50</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Isoc.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">9.31</span> </span>, etc. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">factious combination</b> for elections, <span class=\"gk\">ἐκ π. ἢ καὶ δεκασμοῦ</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">D.C.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">53.21</span> </span>.</div></div>"}